    <description>Updates the AutoRenewal and Renewal Term based on Contract has Auto Renewal Terms updated.
Update Approval Status,Contract URL and Start Date on Opportunity-BOPI-569
Update the Ship To Account to Opportunity Ship To Account if it is Null. BOPI-599
BOPI-604 Sync Opp Ship To Account first
BOPI-693 On Amendment and Renewals do not override Renewal Term to Blank
SALDEV-1072- Update the Renewal Term when Auto Renewal is No
SALDEV-1096 - On Terminate Contract update the Status to Client Approved.
SALDEV-1165 - Set the Opp Type to Cancellation if all the QL has Qty 0.</description>
